{
  "slug": "getlark",
  "name": "Getlark",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Natural-language end-to-end tests for any software surface, powered by getlark.ai",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `create-workflow` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create a workflow\", \"create a getlark test\", \"add…), `getlark-overview` (This skill should be used when the user mentions \"getlark\", \"getlark.ai\", \"larkci\", \"larkci CLI\", \"end-to-end test workflow\", or…), `invoke-workflow` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"run a workflow\", \"invoke a larkci workflow\", \"run…), `manage` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"list workflows\", \"show getlark workflows\", \"get workflow details\",…), `manage-bulk` (This skill should be used when the user wants to create a bunch of workflows in lark in…), `setup` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"set up getlark\", \"install larkci\", \"install the getlark…), `validate-branch` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"validate the branch\", \"validate this branch\", \"test this…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install getlark@claude-community` from `getlark/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "hook": 1
  },
